Subject: [PATCH] horizon_display: show RGBA frames through
 libnx2linux_display.so (ctypes)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: S7bis display path: the Python side of the Vulkan window a recompiled game draws into (linux/host/display.c); the test skips without the library
Issue: none yet (NX2Linux, branch swann/jalon-s7bis-xc2)

---
